---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="About Praveer Gupta."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About Me</h1>
			<p>
				I am an engineering leader with 16+ years of experience building secure,
				scalable, and product-focused platforms across productivity, cloud, and
				enterprise software. I enjoy solving complex problems at the
				intersection of architecture, product, and execution, helping teams turn
				ambitious ideas into systems that are reliable, measurable, and built
				for long-term business impact.
			</p>
			<p>
				My journey has spanned product and platform engineering at Microsoft,
				Expedia Group, ThoughtWorks, and Deloitte Consulting, where I have led
				teams building everything from enterprise integrations and cloud-native
				systems to AI-powered growth platforms. More recently, I have been
				focused on building internal platforms for personalized messaging and
				campaign execution, helping teams drive growth through more intelligent,
				data-driven engagement.
			</p>
			<p>
				I care deeply about strong engineering fundamentals, good systems
				design, and creating teams and products that can scale with the
				business. I also enjoy working closely with product and business
				stakeholders to turn technical opportunities into practical outcomes.
			</p>
			<p>
				<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/praveer-gupta-550159a/">
					Connect with me on LinkedIn
				</a>
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
